note bottom of InventoryCommandServiceImpl
  Receipt lock before operationId lookup; batch locked before consumption.
  Stock, movement and Batch usage share one transaction.
  Same operationId + same values returns the original result.
end note
note bottom of RawMaterialBatch
  QUARANTINED -> RELEASED only after QA/Admin review.
  RELEASED -> OBSERVED; any non-rejected state -> REJECTED.
  Only RELEASED receipts with positive stock can be consumed.
  Receipt date <= business date < expiration date (America/Lima).
  No implicit unit conversion; units must match.
end note
note bottom of InventoryMovement
  Append-only application history: RECEIPT, REVIEW,
  CONSUMPTION and OPENING_BALANCE.
end note
note bottom of InventoryController
  Tenant access enforced for every operation.
  Review and legacy import additionally require QA_MANAGER or ADMIN.
end note

